        ("ZAPPI RELEASE · 5 OCT", "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/social-video-ads-are-standing-out-but-losing-the-brand-new-research-from-zappi-finds-302897474.html"),
        ("ADVANCED TELEVISION · 5 OCT", "https://www.advanced-television.com/2026/10/05/report-social-video-ads-are-standing-out-but-losing-the-brand/"),
